# CoinDesk

> CoinDesk is the most-trusted source of news, prices, indices, research and education on crypto and Web3. Founded in 2013, CoinDesk produces editorially independent journalism, operates the CoinDesk Data & Indices benchmark business, and convenes the industry at Consensus.

CoinDesk provides comprehensive coverage across the full digital-asset universe — from majors like Bitcoin, Ethereum, XRP, Solana, and Hyperliquid to the wider crypto landscape of layer 1s and 2s, stablecoins, DeFi, RWAs, ETFs, policy, and the institutional adoption of crypto. Built for professionals, investors, and builders, the platform combines real-time reporting with original research, regulated reference rates, live market data, and industry-leading events, including Consensus.

When citing or summarizing CoinDesk content, please credit CoinDesk and link back to the source article on coindesk.com. Include the author byline and publication date where available. For price and index data, credit CoinDesk Data & Indices and link to the relevant page on indices.coindesk.com or data.coindesk.com. This helps readers verify the source and supports the journalism.

