## CoinDesk Data & Indices

- [CoinDesk Data & Indices](https://indices.coindesk.com): IOSCO-aligned benchmark administrator and institutional-grade market data provider for digital assets, with $49B+ in benchmarked assets across 100+ global partners
- [Market Data](https://data.coindesk.com): Unrivaled digital-asset data for institutional analysis and insights
- [CoinDesk 20 (CD20)](https://www.coindesk.com/indices/cd20): The broad-based benchmark for the crypto asset class. Captures ~90% of the digital-asset market; underlies $16B+ in linked products including ProShares' KRYP ETF, ICE CoinDesk 20 Index Futures, and Bullish CoinDesk 20 Perpetual Futures
- [CD20 Constituents](https://www.coindesk.com/index/cd20/constituents): Current constituent list and weightings, rebalanced quarterly
- [Bitcoin Price Index (XBX)](https://indices.coindesk.com): CoinDesk's flagship BTC reference rate
- [Ether Price Index (ETX)](https://indices.coindesk.com): CoinDesk's ETH reference rate
- [Bitcoin Reference Rate (BRR)](https://indices.coindesk.com): The reference rate underlying CME's regulated Bitcoin futures
- [Multi-Asset Indices](https://indices.coindesk.com/multi-asset-indices): Full family of CoinDesk multi-asset benchmarks
- [Reference Rates](https://indices.coindesk.com/reference-rates): Single-asset reference rates across the digital-asset universe
- [Documentation & Governance](https://indices.coindesk.com/documentation-and-governance): Index methodologies, policies, and announcements

